# ==============================================================
# OCEAN PUZZLE - EXIT (3 of 5)
# ==============================================================
# Script type : walk
# Bind to     : 8 floor blocks, one bind each (test server coords):
#               -1847 72 1556, -1846 72 1556, -1845 72 1556,
#               -1844 72 1556, -1843 72 1556, -1842 72 1556,
#               -1841 72 1556, -1840 72 1556
# Map/area    : [FILL IN: map name / room]
# Import      : /script import walk <paste URL>, then click the block
#
# What it does:
#   Rebuilds the wall over the stairway after a player leaves
#   the puzzle area, returning the entrance to normal.
#
# Placement note:
#   Just past the top of the stairway, once the player is back
#   through the entrance.
#
# Map coordinates used inside this script:
#   Stair ceiling : -1846 70 1562 to -1841 70 1565
#   Stair wall    : -1846 69 1565 to -1841 67 1565
#   (must match the Submit script)
#
# Requires: nothing
# Related scripts: Submit (1), Entrance (2), Reset (4), Note Tune (5)
# ==============================================================
@bypass /fill -1846 70 1562 -1841 70 1565 prismarine_bricks
@bypass /fill -1846 69 1565 -1841 67 1565 prismarine_bricks
